After discussion with LSI and Dell engineers, we feel that keeping the
linux-megaraid-devel@dell.com mailing list separate from the
linux-scsi@vger.kernel.org mailing list is not beneficial, and in fact,
has decreased collaboration between the larger Linux kernel development
community and megaraid developers.

Therefore, I am going to disable the linux-megaraid-devel mailing list, 
and have it auto-respond to senders requesting that they post to 
linux-scsi@vger.kernel.org instead.

Thank you for your participation on linux-megaraid-devel, and we look 
forward to your continued involvement on linux-scsi.  You may subscribe to
linux-scsi by visiting http://vger.kernel.org/vger-lists.html#linux-scsi

Thanks,
